  "description": "Shared Consul service discovery for NextLevel backends. One blocking-query watcher per process, shared by every consumer, with the NextLevel metadata contract (public-host, env, scheme, gameCode; tags nl-game, nl-test, the family tags and the value-bearing nl-provider-/nl-category- tags) typed once. Includes the game-catalog surface used by game-launch-api. Takes no reverse-proxy dependency — the gateway's YARP integration lives in NextLevel.ServiceDiscovery.Yarp.",
